\p
\v 10 \add One time when\add* there was¦4910 \add a drought causing\add* a¦4911 severe food shortage¦4911, Abram¦4914 \add and his household\add* travelled \add west\add* across to¦4915 Egypt¦4915 \add !(Mitsrayim¦4915)\add* to¦4916 stay¦4916 there¦4917.
