\v 13 \add Please\add* tell¦4959 them that¦4964 you're my¦4962 sister¦4962 so¦4964 they'll treat me well¦4965 because¦4968 of¦4968 you¦4968 and¦4969 let me live¦4969.”\x + \xo 12:13: \xt Gen 20:2; 26:7.\x*
