\v 6 but¦5158 the¦5162 land¦5162 couldn't support¦5160 them¦5161 \add all\add* while they stayed¦5163 together¦5164. Because¦5165 \add the needs of\add* their¦5168 combined assets were¦5167 so¦5170 \add demanding\add*, they¦5171 couldn't all \add thrive\add* in one place
