\v 5 Then¦5462 in¦5462 the fourteenth year¦5464, Kedorlaomer¦5466 and¦5467 the¦5467 kings¦5467 who¦5468 were with¦5469 him¦5469 went¦5465 and¦5470 attacked¦5470 the¦5473 Refaim¦5473 in¦5474 Ashteroth¦5474-Karnaim¦5475, and¦5476 the¦5478 Zuzim in¦5479 Ham¦5479, and¦5480 the¦5481 Emim¦5481 in¦5482 Shaveh¦5482-Kiriathaim¦5483,
