\v 8 Then¦5521 the¦5522 king¦5522 of¦5522 Sodom¦5524, the¦5525 king¦5525 of¦5525 Amorah¦5526 \add !(Gomorrah¦5526)\add*, the¦5527 king¦5527 of¦5527 Admah¦5528, the¦5529 king¦5529 of¦5529 Tsevoim¦5530, and¦5532 the¦5532 king¦5532 of¦5532 Bela¦5533 (also called Zoar¦5536) went¦5521 out¦5521 into¦5540 the¦5541 Siddim¦5541 Valley¦5540 and arranged \add their troops\add* for battle¦5539
\v 9 against Kedorlaomer¦5544 king¦5545 of¦5545 Elam¦5546, Tidal¦5547 king¦5548 of¦5548 Goiim, Amrafel king¦5551 of¦5551 Shinar¦5552, Arioch¦5553 king¦5554 of¦5554 Ellasar¦5555—five¦5560 kings¦5557 \add defending themselves\add* against the¦5560 four¦5556.
