\v 22 Then¦7162 the¦7164 \add other two\add* men¦7164 left¦7165 and¦7165 started descending toward¦7166 Sodom, and¦7167 Abraham¦7167 was still¦7168 standing¦7169 there¦7163 in¦7170 front¦7170 of¦7170 Yahweh¦7171,
\v 23 \add ≈so¦7173\add* \add *he¦7174\add* went closer \add to Yahweh\add* and¦7175 asked¦7175, “Will¦7177 you¦7177 really destroy obedient people along with¦7179 those who are evil¦7181?
