\p
\v 1 \add ≈So¦7364\add* the¦7365 two¦7365 messengers¦7366 arrived¦7364 at Sodom¦7373 in¦7368 the evening¦7368, and¦7369 Lot¦7369 was¦7370 sitting¦7370 at the¦7371 city gate¦7371. When¦7374 Lot¦7376 saw¦7374 them, he¦7377 got up¦7377 to¦7378 meet¦7378 them¦7378 and¦7379 knelt down¦7379 in front of them with \add &his\add* face¦7380 to¦7381 the¦7381 ground¦7381.
\v 2 Then¦7383 he¦7383 said¦7383, “Listen, my¦7387 masters¦7387: Come¦7398 with me to¦7390 your¦7393 slave's¦7393 home and¦7395 wash¦7395 your¦7393 feet¦7396 and¦7394 stay¦7394 the¦7394 night¦7394. Then¦7397 you¦7397 can get up early¦7397 and continue on your¦7400 way¦7400.”
