\v 9 But¦7512 they¦7512 insisted, “Stand back!” Then¦7517 they¦7517 said¦7517 \add to each other\add*, “This guy came¦7519 to¦7521 stay¦7521 with us, and¦7522 now¦7524 he's¦7522 judging us. We'll¦7525 treat you worse than¦7527 them¦7527!” Then¦7528 they¦7528 started pushing hard against Lot¦7530 and¦7532 \add ≈came¦7532 closer¦7532\add* to¦7533 break¦7533 down¦7533 the¦7534 door¦7534.
