\v 11 Then¦7552 they¦7559 struck¦7559 the¦7554 men¦7554 who¦7555 were¦7557 at the¦7557 entrance¦7557 of¦7557 the¦7558 house¦7558 with¦7560 blindness¦7560—\add all of them\add* from¦7561 the lowly¦7561 to¦7562 the prominent men—so¦7565 that they¦7565 gave up trying to¦7566 find¦7566 the¦7567 door¦7567.\x + \xo 19:11: \xt 2Ki 6:18.\x*
