\v 14 Then¦7612 Lot¦7613 went¦7612 out¦7612 and¦7614 spoke¦7614 to¦7616 his \add future\add* sons-in-law who¦7620 were¦7620 \add engaged\add* to¦7620 his¦7621 daughters¦7621, and¦7622 he¦7622 told¦7622 them, “\add Hurry\add*, get¦7620 out¦7624 of this¦7628 place¦7627, because¦7629 Yahweh¦7632 is¦7631 going to¦7631 destroy¦7631 the¦7635 city¦7635!” But¦7636 they thought he¦7636 was¦7636 just joking¦7637.
