\v 15 At dawn¦7642 the next day, the \add two\add* messengers¦7645 urged¦7644 Lot¦7646, saying¦7647, “Get up¦7643, take¦7649 your¦7652 wife¦7652 and¦7653 your two¦7655 daughters¦7656 who¦7657 are¦7657 here, so that all of you¦7660 won't be¦7660 swept¦7660 away¦7660 in¦7661 the¦7661 punishment¦7661 of¦7661 the¦7662 city¦7662.”
