\v 17 At that point \add one of them\add* told¦7687 Lot, “Flee for your¦7691 \add #lives¦7691\add*! Don't¦7692 \add turn around and\add* look¦7694 behind¦7695 you¦7695 and¦7696 don't¦7696 stop¦7698 anywhere \add down\add* in¦7699 the¦7701 plain¦7701. Escape \add up to\add* the¦7702 hills¦7702 so you¦7706 don't get swept¦7706 away¦7706!”
