\p
\v 30 Then¦7912 Lot¦7913 and his two daughters left Zoar¦7914 and¦7915 settled up in¦7916 the¦7917 hills, because¦7920 he¦7921 was¦7921 afraid¦7921 to¦7922 stay¦7922 in¦7923 Zoar¦7923. So¦7924 he¦7924 lived¦7924 in¦7925 a cave¦7925 \add up there\add* with his two¦7927 daughters¦7928.
