\v 32 So let's¦7948 get Dad drunk¦7948 and then we¦7953 can lie¦7953 with¦7954 him¦7954, so¦7955 that¦7955 at least we¦7955 can have some descendants¦7957 through our father.”
\v 33 \add ≈So\add* then, they¦7959 got their father to drink¦7959 wine¦7963 that¦7965 evening, and the¦7967 oldest¦7967 daughter went and¦7968 lay¦7968 with¦7969 her father¦7971, but he wasn't aware of¦7971 her¦7971 coming¦7966 or going.
