\v 34 Then¦7979 the¦7980 next¦7980 day¦7980, the older girl said¦7981 to¦7983 the¦7985 younger¦7985, Listen, last¦7989 night I lay¦7988 with¦7990 my¦7992 father. Let's¦7993 get him¦7993 drunk¦7993 again tonight then¦7998 you go¦7998 lie¦7999 with¦8000 him¦8000 so¦8001 that¦8001 we'll¦8001 give life¦8001 to descendants¦8003 through our father.”
