\v 36 In that way, both¦8024 of¦8024 Lot's¦8027 daughters¦8025 got themselves pregnant¦8023 through their¦8028 father¦8028.
\v 37 Then¦8030 the¦8031 eldest¦8031 daughter gave¦8030 birth¦8030 to a¦8032 son¦8032 and¦8033 she¦8033 named¦8033 him Moab¦8035 \add (which means ‘from my father’)\add*. (He's¦8036 the¦8037 ancestor¦8037 of¦8037 the¦8042 Moabites to this day¦8042.)
