\p
\v 1 Then¦8065 Abraham¦8067 travelled from¦8066 there¦8066 to the¦8069 Negev¦8069 region¦8068 and¦8070 he¦8070 settled between¦8071 Kadesh¦8073 and¦8074 Shur¦8075, staying¦8076 in¦8077 Gerar¦8077 for a while.
