\p
\v 4 Now Abimelech¦8117 hadn't gone near¦8119 to¦8120 her¦8120, so¦8121 he¦8121 said¦8121, “My¦8122 master¦8122, would¦8127 you¦8127 destroy¦8127 a¦8123 nation¦8123 even though it's innocent?
