\v 6 Then¦8152 God said¦8152 to¦8153 him¦8153 in the dream¦8155, “Yes¦8175, I know¦8158 that¦8159 you¦8163 did¦8163 this¦8164 with a \add clear conscience\add* and¦8165 indeed I¦8165 kept¦8165 you¦8169 from¦8170 sinning¦8170 against me¦8172. I¦8178 didn't¦8176 allow¦8178 you¦8178 to¦8179 touch¦8179 her¦8180 for that reason.
\v 7 \add ≈So¦8182\add* now¦8182, return¦8183 that man's¦8186 wife¦8184 because¦8187 he's a¦8189 prophet¦8189, and¦8191 he'll¦8191 pray¦8191 for¦8192 you¦8192 and¦8193 you'll¦8202 live¦8193. But¦8194 if¦8194 you¦8196 don't¦8196 return¦8197 her¦8197, be certain that¦8199 you¦8203 and¦8204 all¦8204 your people will surely¦8201 die.”
