\v 16 Then¦8358 he¦8359 said¦8359 to¦8358 Sarah¦8358, “Listen, I've¦8361 given¦8361 1,000 pieces of silver¦8363 to¦8364 your¦8364 brother¦8364. That's for¦8368 you¦8368 to¦8371 demonstrate that¦8372 you¦8373 did nothing wrong, so that you're¦8376 completely cleared¦8376.”
