\v 6 and¦8483 Sarah¦8484 said¦8483, “God¦8488 has brought laughter¦8485 to¦8487 me¦8487. Everyone¦8491 who¦8491 hears¦8491 will¦8492 laugh¦8492 with me¦8494.”
\v 7 And¦8496 she¦8496 continued¦8496, “Who¦8497 would have¦8498 said¦8498 to¦8499 Abraham¦8499 that Sarah¦8502 would breastfeed¦8500 children¦8501, yet I¦8505 have¦8505 \add given him\add* a¦8506 son¦8506 in his¦8507 old¦8507 age¦8507.”
