\v 3 Stay¦11424 as a guest in this¦11426 region, and¦11427 I'll¦11427 be¦11427 with¦11428 you¦11428 and¦11429 bless¦11429 you¦11429, because¦11430 I'll¦11434 give¦11434 all¦11437 this \add #land¦11439\add* to¦11432 you and¦11433 to¦11433 your¦11433 descendants¦11433, and¦11441 I'll¦11441 confirm the¦11444 oath¦11444 that¦11445 I¦11446 made to¦11447 your¦11448 father¦11448 Abraham¦11447.\x + \xo 26:3-4: \xt Gen 22:16-18.\x*
