\v 11 Then¦11571 \add King\add* Abimelech¦11572 ordered¦11571 all¦11575 the¦11577 people¦11577, “Anyone¦11579 who¦11579 touches¦11579 this¦11581 man¦11580 or his¦11582 wife¦11582 will¦11584 certainly be¦11584 killed¦11584.”
