\v 14 He¦11609 \add also\add* owned sheep¦11614 and¦11615 goats, and¦11617 cattle, and many slaves. \add Because\add* the¦11621 Philistines¦11621 \add now\add* envied¦11619 him¦11620,
\v 15 they¦11633 blocked¦11633 up¦11633 all¦11623 the¦11625 wells¦11625 that¦11626 his father's slaves had¦11627 dug¦11627 when his¦11629 father¦11629 Abraham¦11631 had been alive, and¦11635 they¦11635 filled¦11635 them¦11635 with dirt.
