\v 16 Then¦11638 \add King\add* Abimelech¦11639 told¦11638 Yitshak¦11642, “You all \add need to\add* leave¦11643 this area because¦11645 you've¦11647 become¦11647 more powerful¦11647 than¦11649 us.”
