\v 1 When¦11950 Yitshak¦11954 grew¦11955 old¦11953 and¦11955 could no longer see¦11957, he¦11958 called¦11958 his¦11963 older son¦11963 Esaw¦11961 and¦11965 said¦11965 to¦11966 him¦11966, “My¦11967 son¦11967.”
