\v 4 and¦11996 cook¦11996 me¦11998 a tasty¦11999 meal in the way that I¦12001 love¦12001 it, and¦12002 bring¦12002 it¦12002 to¦12003 me¦12003 so¦12004 I¦12004 can eat¦12004 it¦12006, so that \add I\add* can bless¦12006 you¦12006 before¦12008 I¦12009 die¦12009.”
