\v 5 \add Now\add* Rebekah¦12011 had been¦12012 listening¦12012 while Yitshak¦12014 spoke¦12013 to¦12015 Esaw¦12017. Then¦12019 Esaw¦12020 went¦12019 \add out\add* to the¦12021 countryside¦12021 to¦12022 hunt¦12023 game¦12023 and bring¦12024 it back.
