\v 14 \add ≈So¦12139\add* he¦12139 went¦12139 and¦12140 \add slaughtered them\add* and¦12141 brought¦12141 \add them\add* to¦12142 his¦12144 mother¦12144. Then¦12143 \add she\add* prepared¦12143 tasty¦12145 food¦12145 the way his¦12148 father¦12148 loved¦12147 \add it\add*.
