\v 27 \add ≈So¦12329\add* he¦12329 went close¦12329 and¦12330 kissed¦12330 him¦12332. \add His dad noticed\add* the¦12336 smell¦12336 of¦12336 his¦12337 clothes¦12337, so¦12338 he¦12338 blessed¦12338 him¦12338 saying¦12339,\x + \xo 27:27-29: \xt Heb 11:20.\x*
\q1 “\add Ah yes,\add* the¦12341 smell¦12341 of¦12341 my¦12342 son¦12342
