\p
\v 30 Then¦12381 just¦12382 as¦12382 Yitshak had¦12383 finished¦12383 blessing¦12385 Yacob¦12388, and¦12389 as Yacob¦12393 had¦12392 only just gone¦12392 out¦12392 from¦12394 his¦12397 father's¦12397 presence, his brother Esaw¦12398 his¦12399 brother¦12399 \add returned\add* from¦12401 his¦12401 hunting¦12401.
