\v 34 When Esaw¦12462 heard¦12461 \add that\add*, then¦12467 he¦12467 let out a¦12468 very loud and¦12470 exceedingly bitter¦12470 wail, and¦12474 \add then begged\add* his father, “Bless¦12476 me too, my¦12480 father¦12480.”
