\v 35 But¦12482 \add @Yitshak¦12482\add* replied¦12482, “Your¦12484 brother¦12484 came¦12483 \add in and deceived me\add* and¦12486 he's¦12486 taken¦12486 your¦12487 blessing¦12487!”
