\v 41 That's how it was for¦15044 me¦15044 for twenty¦15045 years¦15046 in¦15047 your¦15047 house¦15047. I¦15048 \add worked for you for\add* fourteen years¦15052 for¦15053 your two¦15053 daughters¦15054, then¦15055 six¦15055 \add more\add* years¦15056 for¦15057 your¦15057 flocks¦15057, and¦15058 you¦15058 changed¦15058 my¦15061 wages¦15061 ten¦15062 times¦15063 \add to your advantage\add*.
