\v 53 May Abraham's¦15266 god and¦15267 the¦15267 gods¦15267 of¦15267 their ancestor Nahor¦15268 judge¦15269 between¦15270 us¦15270.” Then¦15273 Yacob¦15274 swore¦15273 by¦15275 the¦15275 one respected¦15275 by his¦15276 father¦15276 Yitshak¦15277,
