\rem /s1 Jacob Returns to Bethel; Jacob's Return to Bethel; God Blesses Jacob at Bethel
\p
\v 1 Then¦16757 God¦16758 told¦16757 Yacob¦16761, “\add Pack\add* up¦16763 and \add move\add* to Beyt¦16764-El¦16766 and¦16767 settle¦16767 there¦16769, and¦16770 make¦16770 an¦16773 altar¦16773 there to¦16774 the god¦16774 who¦16775 appeared¦16775 to¦16776 you¦16776 when¦16777 you¦16777 were fleeing¦16777 from¦16779 your¦16781 brother¦16781 Esaw¦16780.”\x + \xo 35:1: \xt Gen 28:11-17.\x*
