\v 2 \add ≈So¦16783\add* Yacob¦16784 instructed his¦16787 household¦16787 and¦16788 \add everyone\add* with¦16792 him¦16792, “Remove¦16793 \add any\add* \add ≈foreign¦16797\add* \add idols\add* that¦16798 are¦16799 among¦16799 you¦16799, and¦16800 purify¦16800 yourselves¦16800 and¦16801 change¦16801 your¦16802 clothes¦16802.
\v 3 Then¦16804 \add we'll leave here\add* and¦16805 \add make the uphill trip\add* to Beyt¦16806-El¦16808, and¦16809 I'll¦16809 make¦16809 an¦16812 altar¦16812 there¦16811 to¦16813 God¦16813, who¦16814 answered¦16814 me¦16815 \add when I was\add* distressed¦16817. He's¦16818 been¦16818 with¦16819 me¦16819 \add wherever\add* I've¦16822 gone¦16822.”
