\v 9 Then¦17962 \add @Yosef¦17962\add* \add had\add* another dream, and¦17966 \add again\add* he¦17966 told¦17966 his¦17968 brothers¦17968, “Listen, I¦17971 \add had\add* another dream¦17972, and¦17974 wow¦17974, the¦17975 sun¦17975 and¦17976 the¦17976 moon¦17976 and¦17977 eleven stars¦17979 were¦17980 bowing¦17980 down¦17980 to¦17981 me¦17981.”
