\v 14 Then¦18046 he¦18046 \add ≈told¦18046\add* him¦18047, “Please¦18050 go¦18048 and see¦18051 \add how\add* your¦18055 brothers¦18055 \add are doing\add* and¦18056 the \add #flocks¦18059\add* \add as well\add*, then¦18060 \add come and let me know\add*.”
