\v 15 \add When he got there,\add* a¦18069 man¦18069 \add noticed\add* him wandering¦18071 around the¦18072 countryside¦18072 and¦18073 asked¦18073 him¦18073, “What¦18076 are¦18078 you¦18078 \add ≈looking¦18078 for¦18078\add*?”
