\v 32 Then¦18344 they¦18344 sent¦18344 the¦18347 coloured robe¦18347 \add back\add* to¦18350 their¦18352 father¦18352 with this¦18354 message: “We¦18355 found¦18355 this. Please¦18358 examine whether or not it's¦18361 your¦18360 son's¦18360 robe.”
