\p
\v 36 Meanwhile, the¦18413 Midianites \add arrived\add* in¦18416 Egypt¦18418 and sold¦18414 him¦18415 to¦18419 Potifar¦18419—Far'oh's¦18421 captain of¦18422 the¦18423 guards¦18423.
\c 38
