\v 17 “I'll¦18681 send¦18681 \add you\add* a young goat¦18684 from¦18685 my flock¦18687,” he replied.
\p “But what about¦18682 \add something to keep now as\add* a¦18692 pledge¦18692 until¦18693 you¦18694 send¦18694 it,” she \add bartered\add*.
