\v 25 \add So they got her and\add* brought¦18816 her out¦18816, \add but\add* she sent¦18818 a message to¦18819 her¦18821 father-in-law¦18821, saying¦18822, “It was the man¦18823 who¦18824 these¦18826 things belong¦18834 to¦18834 that got me pregnant¦18829.” Then¦18830 she¦18830 \add added\add*, “Please¦18833 identify whose signet ring and¦18836 cords¦18836 and¦18837 staff¦18837 these¦18838 are.”
