\v 26 \add When\add* Yehudah¦18841 recognised¦18840 \add the items\add*, he¦18842 admitted, “She's¦18843 more¦18844 \add in the right\add* than¦18844 I am,\x + \xo 38:26: \xt 37:11.\x* because¦18845 I¦18852 didn't give¦18852 my¦18854 son¦18854 Shelah¦18853 to¦18859 her¦18859.” \add But\add* he didn't \add lie with her again\add*.
\p
