\v 18 and¦19992 then listen¦19992, up¦19996 from¦19993 the¦19995 river¦19995 came¦19996 seven¦19997 cows¦19998. \add They were\add* well-fed and¦20001 good-looking, and¦20003 they¦20003 grazed¦20003 among¦20004 the reeds¦20004.
