\v 46 Yosef¦20456 was¦20457 thirty¦20459 years¦20460 old when¦20461 he'd \add been called to\add* stand¦20461 before¦20462 Far'oh¦20463 king¦20464 of¦20464 Egypt¦20466. \add When he left\add* Far'oh's¦20470 presence¦20469, he¦20471 travelled¦20471 throughout the¦20475 land¦20475 of¦20475 Egypt¦20476
\v 47 and¦20478 the¦20479 land¦20479 produced¦20478 outstanding harvests during¦20480 the seven¦20480 years¦20481 of¦20481 plenty¦20482.
