\v 53 Then¦20582 the seven¦20583 years¦20584 of¦20584 plenty¦20585 in¦20588 Egypt¦20589 came¦20582 to¦20582 an¦20582 end¦20582
\v 54 and¦20591 the seven¦20592 years¦20593 of¦20593 famine¦20594 started¦20591, just¦20596 as¦20596 Yosef¦20598 had¦20597 said¦20597. The famine \add covered the entire wider region\add*, but¦20604 \add it was different in\add* Egypt¦20607.\x + \xo 41:54: \xt Acts 7:11.\x*
\v 55 All¦20612 the¦20614 land¦20614 of¦20614 Egypt¦20615 became famished¦20611, and¦20616 the¦20617 people¦20617 cried¦20616 to¦20618 \add the king\add* for¦20621 food¦20621, so¦20622 Far'oh¦20623 said¦20622 to¦20624 all¦20624 the Egyptians, “Go¦20627 to¦20628 Yosef¦20630 \add and\add* do whatever he¦20633 tells¦20633 you.”\x + \xo 41:55: \xt Yhn 2:5.\x*
