\v 9 “\add I've been moving from place to place for\add* 130 years,” Yacob¦23599 \add ≈replied¦23598\add*. “\add My life has been short and with many difficulties, so I\add* haven't reached¦23616 the¦23619 longer \add ages of my ancestors in their moving around\add*.”
